{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4》戰況進入白熱化階段，十強選手之一的蔡宓婕發揮出色，深受觀眾喜愛。蔡宓婕近日在社交平台上載了一張溫馨的全家福，透露在上一集比賽中，獲得老公及仔仔親臨現場支持。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蔡宓婕發文時感動留言：「The first time my sons came to watch the contest ,I know you guys are super proud of me ,And that’s enough 🫶🏻」（仔仔們第一次來到現場睇比賽，我知道你們都為我感到非常自豪，這樣就足夠了。）字裡行間洋溢著滿滿的幸福與滿足感。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"884d8594-ed36-420d-a5dc-30901c265279.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ogn9mZIkJM1786527764.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"884d8594-ed36-420d-a5dc-30901c265279.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"182ee3fa-7bda-44b1-a327-7a0dd1dadc56.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20264QhAmwYPTx1786527764.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"182ee3fa-7bda-44b1-a327-7a0dd1dadc56.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在這張溫馨合照中，蔡宓婕高顏值的繼子意外成為網民的關注焦點。不少網民看過合照後，紛紛被繼子的出眾外型吸引，留言大讚他「高大又靚仔」，瞬間引發一眾網民熱烈討論。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T11:59:09.901914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}